  "title": "How to Build a Stronger SMB Underwriting Data Strategy in 2026",
  "summary": "SMB underwriting relies on a complex mix of traditional business financials, personal credit histories, and real-time cash flow analysis—and there's no single commercial equivalent to a consumer FICO score to simplify the process. That complexity is exactly why lenders who get their data strategy right pull ahead, while those who don't watch deals slip away to faster competitors.",
